:1px solid #000000;padding:2px 3px;\">du h\u1ecdc sinh trao \u0111\u1ed5i ng\u1eafn h\u1ea1n<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><h4><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h4><h3 style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u6587\u578b\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center;\">DANH S\u00c1CH NG\u1eee PH\u00c1P<\/h3><p>&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>A. M\u1eabu ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p ch\u00ednh<\/strong><\/h4><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h5 style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>1. \uff5e\u306f\uff5e\u3067\u3059<\/strong><\/h5><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:50.27%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><ul><li><p>\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306f\u3000\u30d5\u30a9\u30f3\u3067\u3059 \u3002<\/p><p>(T\u00f4i t\u00ean l\u00e0 Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng.)<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306f\u300023 \u3055\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002<\/p><p>(T\u00f4i 23 tu\u1ed5i.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><h6>&nbsp;<\/h6><h6><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u><\/span><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ec1 t\u00e0i n\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 m\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u00f3i mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ec1 c\u1eadp \u0111\u1ebfn. N1 l\u00e0 ch\u1ee7 ng\u1eef c\u00f2n N2 l\u00e0 v\u1ecb ng\u1eef&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><h6><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><u>b. \u00dd ngh\u0129a&nbsp;<\/u><\/span><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\u201c\u2026.. N1 l\u00e0 N2\u2026.\u201d<\/span><\/p><h6><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><u>c. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u><\/span><\/h6><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:39.05%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">N1 <strong><u>\u306f <\/u><\/strong>N2 <strong><u>\u3067\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><h5 style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;<\/h5><h5 style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>2.N\u3067\u3059\u304b\u3002<\/strong><\/h5><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:77.05%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1pt solid #000000;padding:5pt;vertical-align:top;\"><ul><li><p>\u30ea\u3055\u3093\u306f\u3001\u304c\u304f\u305b\u3044<strong><u>\u3067\u3059\u304b<\/u><\/strong> \u3002 &nbsp; &nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp;(Li, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i h\u1ecdc sinh kh\u00f4ng?)<\/p><p>\u2192\uff08\u3007\uff09<strong><u>\u306f\u3044<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u304c\u304f\u305b\u3044<strong><u>\u3067\u3059<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;(V\u00e2ng, t\u00f4i l\u00e0 h\u1ecdc sinh.)<\/p><p>\u2192 \uff08\u2716\uff09<strong><u>\u3044\u3044\u3048<\/u><\/strong>\u3001\u304c\u304f\u305b\u3044<strong><u>\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/p><p>(Kh\u00f4ng, t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i h\u1ecdc sinh.)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><h6>&nbsp;<\/h6><h6><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi C\u00f3\/kh\u00f4ng. Khi h\u1ecfi s\u1ebd l\u00ean gi\u1ecdng ch\u1eef \u304b<\/span><\/p><h6><u>b. \u00dd ngh\u0129a&nbsp;<\/u><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;\u201cS c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i N hay kh\u00f4ng?\u201d<\/span><\/p><h6><u>c. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac&nbsp;<\/u>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span><\/h6><p>&nbsp;<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:51.17%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p>\u301c\u306f\u3000N\u3067\u3059<strong><u>\u304b<\/u><\/strong>\u3002<\/p><p>\uff08\