=\"font-size:11pt;\">\u30d9\u30c8\u30ca\u30e0<strong><u>\u3054<\/u>&nbsp;<\/strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;(Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t\uff09<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">\u3048\u3044<strong><u>\u3054<\/u><\/strong> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(Ti\u1ebfng Anh\uff09&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><h6><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng&nbsp;<\/u><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Th\u00eam \u3054 v\u00e0o sau t\u00ean n\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 di\u1ec5n t\u1ea3 ngh\u0129a Ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef,...&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><h6><u>b. \u00dd ngh\u0129a&nbsp;<\/u><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\u201cTi\u1ebfng\u2026..\u201d<\/span><\/p><h6><u>c. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u><\/h6><p>&nbsp;<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:30.85%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">N(Qu\u1ed1c gia) + <strong>\u3054<\/strong><\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><h5><strong>5\uff0e\u306a\u3093\u306d\u3093\u305b\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304b<\/strong><\/h5><h6>&nbsp;<\/h6><h6><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ecfi th\u00f4ng tin sinh vi\u00ean n\u0103m m\u1ea5y?<\/span><\/p><h6><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><u>b. \u00dd &nbsp;ngh\u0129a:<\/u><\/span><\/h6><p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\">\u201cSinh vi\u00ean n\u0103m m\u1ea5y?\u201d<\/span><\/p><h6><u>b. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u><\/h6><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:53.61%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">\u306a\u3093<strong>\u306d\u3093\u305b\u3044<\/strong>\u3000\u3067\u3059<u>\u304b<\/u>\u3002<\/s